  "bio": "Immerse yourself in the dynamic art of trashpolka at Lucky Heads Tattoo, a hub of creativity nestled in the heart of Itzehoe, Germany. Since 2012, this studio has cultivated a space where spontaneity thrives—drop by for a consultation without an appointment from Tuesday to Friday between 12 to 18, and on Saturday from 12 to 15, to begin your inking journey. Here, the bespoke and the bold collide, creating tattoos that are as unique as the stories they tell.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Itzehoe, Schleswig-holstein, Germany",
